remake trucker job
- it is now inspired by singleplayer entirely
 - unlock new jobs after x amount of runs
- randomized deload locations all over san andreas
(You are sent to a depot to pick up the trailer specific to the randomized location)
- time limit, able to recieve time bonus
- simplify the toll system and only place them at each border
- a player starts this at the trucker depot in los santos. The job they get is randomized to combat minmaxing. 
- high level drivers get a “overqualified” bonus when doing low tier job so it doesnt feel like theyre missing out

This will severely improve script optimization and remove minmaxing income.

Tier 1:
 - using vans for transport (pony, burrito, rc van, …)
 - inside the city of los santos
 - having x crates to offload within time limit

Tier 2:
 - using small trucks for transport (benson, boxville, rumpo, …)
 - inside los santos and red county
 - more items to transport, bit more time

Tier 3:
Using actual trucks, having x time to pick up trailer from trailer depot which adds extra time
- all of bone county, all of red county and los santos 
 - only articulated trailers and hoppers

Tier 4:
Same as tier 3
 - transporting cars and gasoline trailers
 - all over the map
 - slightly less time, but better pay overall